=== prompt
Log the multiplication table for 1 to 3 with nested loops: one line per pair, formatted like `2x3=6`, with the left number in the outer loop.
=== expected
1x1=1
1x2=2
1x3=3
2x1=2
2x2=4
2x3=6
3x1=3
3x2=6
3x3=9
=== reference
0 | Var(a)
Repeat({
  Inc(a)
  0 | Var(b)
  Repeat({ Inc(b) f"{a}x{b}={a | Math.Multiply(b)}" | Log } times: 3)
} times: 3)
